[agent] Now I understand the task. I need to:
[agent] 1. Read the user embeddings, item embeddings, and interactions data
[agent] 2. For each user, compute dot products between their embedding and all item embeddings
[agent] 3. Exclude items the user has already interacted with
[agent] 4. Rank the remaining items by dot product (descending), breaking ties by ascending item_id
[agent] 5. Take the top 5 for each user
[agent] 6. Create a feature table named `recs02400f` version 1 on Databricks platform with columns: rec_id, user_id, rank, item_id
[agent] 7. Make the table available for low-latency lookup (online/real-time access)
